prompts.body:
Write a reply to the following customer request:

{{request}}

The customer is called {{name}}. The current state is: {{state}}.

Reply to this complaint:

{{complaint}}

Take the frustration seriously and name {{action}} as the next step.

Review the following change:

{{diff}}

Look at readability, error handling and tests. The language is {{language}}.

Explain this error message:

{{message}}

The environment is {{environment}}. Name the three most likely causes.

Derive test cases from this requirement:

{{requirement}}

For every case, state the starting point and the expected outcome.

Write a commit message for this change:

{{change}}

First line at most 72 characters, then the reasoning.

Suggest improvements for this code:

{{code}}

Give the reason for every suggestion and say what it costs.

Document this endpoint:

{{endpoint}}

Name its purpose, parameters, response and error cases.

Explain this regular expression piece by piece:

{{expression}}

Give two strings that match and two that do not.

Interpret this log excerpt:

{{excerpt}}

What happened, and what would be the next step?

Summarise the following text:

{{text}}

The summary should be {{length}}.

Interpret these figures:

{{figures}}

The period is {{period}}. Say what stands out and what it could mean.

Ask ten follow-up questions about this text:

{{text}}

The aim of the questions is {{aim}}.

Translate the following text into {{target}}:

{{text}}

Keep the tone.

Rewrite the following text in plain language:

{{text}}

Short sentences, no jargon.

Put this quote in context:

{{quote}}

The context is {{context}}.

Turn these notes into minutes:

{{notes}}

The meeting took place on {{date}}, participants: {{participants}}.

Pull the tasks out of this text:

{{text}}

For every task, name the person responsible and a deadline.
